  1→/**
  2→ * OAuth credential management for AI providers.
  3→ *
  4→ * This module handles login, token refresh, and credential storage
  5→ * for OAuth-based providers:
  6→ * - Anthropic (Claude Pro/Max)
  7→ * - GitHub Copilot
  8→ * - Google Cloud Code Assist (Gemini CLI)
  9→ * - Antigravity (Gemini 3, Claude, GPT-OSS via Google Cloud)
 10→ */
 11→
